<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Michael Levin Academic Content YouTube Corpus (@drmichaellevin, 374 Videos / 333.05 Hours): 6 Core Mathematical Laws of Multiscale Morphogenesis & Agential Materials (Multicellular bioelectric collectives, non-neural Gene Regulatory Networks (GRNs), and driven active-matter morphospaces)",
        "Michael Levin Academic Content YouTube Corpus (@drmichaellevin, 374 Videos / 333.05 Hours): 6 Core Mathematical Laws of Multiscale Morphogenesis & Agential Materials faithfully reproduces Multicellular bioelectric collectives, non-neural Gene Regulatory Networks (GRNs), and driven active-matter morphospaces morphology" ;
