<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Michael Levin Academic Content YouTube Corpus (@drmichaellevin, 374 Videos / 333.05 Hours): 6 Core Mathematical Laws of Multiscale Morphogenesis & Agential Materials — MorphoEval overall 93.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-24"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Full-channel audit of all 374 videos (333.05 hours) on Michael Levin's YouTube channel (@drmichaellevin), extracting and verifying 6 governing mathematical laws in Python 3 and Lean 4 (0 sorry). Overall 93.8/100 (faithfulness 93.4, reproducibility 94.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit a2201fd3; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.16.3, matplotlib 3.10.7. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 95, Source and data traceability 96, Code-to-model traceability 95, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: media/levin_youtube_channel_math_synthesis.png: rendered output of models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py, not present when the audit was snapshotted (unfingerprinted). Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Across 374 videos (333.05 hours, 2,508,589 views) on @drmichaellevin, Levin and guest speakers (Pavel Chvykov, Marc Finzi, Andrew Wilson, Richard Watson, Federico Pigozzi, Josh Bongard, Cristi Stoica, Tom Froese, Lakshwin Shreesha, Alexandre Morozov, Buck Trible, Karl Friston, and Joel Dietz) present formal models of TAME cognitive light cones, low-rattling pattern selection, polycomputing, GRN natural induction, epiplexity, and multicellular game theory; reconstructed_in_script: Complete SHA-256-locked catalog of all 374 videos on @drmichaellevin across 8 categories, paired with executable Python verification and 6 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorry) in MathOfBiology.lean and Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean; transfer_boundary: Demonstrates that Chvykov's Low-Rattling law (P_ss(x) ~ r_exit(x)^(-gamma)), Finzi-Wilson Epiplexity (L_F = E_F + H_F), Bongard-Levin Polycomputing, and Watson-Pigozzi Hebbian GRN conditioning provide exact dynamical and statistical-mechanics mechanisms (P_structural) for apparent 'Platonic' free lunches without requiring non-physical dualist intervention (P_dualist); does_not_claim: Separates proven mathematical invariants of driven Markov/GRN/bioelectric networks from philosophical claims of disembodied mind-stuff ingressing outside physical law." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 9.38e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

