    dct:description "Proves non-synaptic ephaptic phase synchronization and axonal bundle self-organization via shared extracellular electric fields | Variables: V_{m,i}: axonal transmembrane voltage; g_eph: extracellular ephaptic field coupling; Δφ: inter-axonal phase difference" ;
    dct:source "Rebbin (2026) @drmichaellevin [SsUmmN1oOgo]; [pZPQetQ_w4g]; Bernard (2024) [mOqb9UQ9RTw]" ;
